Hello<br />
&nbsp;<br />
It has been a record breaking year here at the Red Cross as we have helped more people in the last four months than in the last couple of years combined.&nbsp; We have sent 100&rsquo;s of units of blood all over the country to help those in need, from storms, to shootings, to now the wildfires.&nbsp; We have been able to help many people but we want to be able to help more.&nbsp; That is what I am asking for from you and your organization.&nbsp; I want to have a conversation to see if we can partner in the upcoming months Feb-June and help us prepare for another season, and hope we don&rsquo;t need it.&nbsp; I am looking at having meetings in the month of January to put action plans together for a giant success around South Carolina &nbsp;and show everyone how great of a state we are.&nbsp; I look forward to hearing your thoughts and what time frame will work best for you. &nbsp;<br />
Best Regards,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
